          "rationale": "认为两位创始人具备深厚网络安全经验，理解企业需要在不拖慢业务的前提下阻止错误操作；AI智能体正快速扩大身份攻击面，智能驱动的执行是唯一可规模化的答案。",
          "quote": "Dmitry and Dekel are proven builders who combine deep cybersecurity experience with a real understanding of what enterprises need: security that stops the wrong action without slowing the business down. AI agents are widening the identity attack surface faster than any control can keep up. Intelligence-driven enforcement is the only answer that scales.",
